config PINCTRL_TELINK_B87
	bool "Telink TLSR8278 pin controller driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TELINK_B87_PINCTRL_ENABLED
	help
	  Sets a pin's function (DS-TLSR8278 Table 7-1) and turns its GPIO
	  function off, or gives it back to the GPIO function; selects the
	  SPI or the I2C on the pins the two share (Table 7-3); sets its pull
	  resistor and input enable.
